---
// Homepage promo for the two Matchday Live fan games.
---
<section class="mgs" aria-labelledby="mgs-title">
  <div class="mgs-inner">
    <h2 class="mgs-title" id="mgs-title">Matchday Fan Zone</h2>
    <div class="mgs-grid">
      <a class="mgs-card" href="/man-of-the-match/">
        <span class="mgs-ic" aria-hidden="true">&#11088;</span>
        <span class="mgs-h">Vote for Man of the Match</span>
        <span class="mgs-p">Pick the best Lobi Stars player at every home game.</span>
        <span class="mgs-go">Find out more &rarr;</span>
      </a>
      <a class="mgs-card" href="/predict-and-win/">
        <span class="mgs-ic" aria-hidden="true">&#127919;</span>
        <span class="mgs-h">Predict &amp; Win</span>
        <span class="mgs-p">Predict the final score of home games for the chance to win.</span>
        <span class="mgs-go">Find out more &rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .mgs { background: #15181D; padding: 44px 0; }
  .mgs-inner { max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 5%; }
  .mgs-title { margin: 0 0 20px; font: 400 clamp(30px, 4vw, 42px)/1 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #fff; }
  .mgs-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }
  .mgs-card {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; padding: 24px; border-radius: 14px; text-decoration: none; color: #fff;
    background: radial-gradient(120% 160% at 0% 0%, #7A0F12 0%, #2A0507 70%); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .12);
    transition: transform .15s, border-color .15s;
  }
  .mgs-card:hover, .mgs-card:focus-visible { transform: translateY(-2px); border-color: #FFC72C; outline: none; }
  .mgs-ic { font-size: 30px; }
  .mgs-h { font: 400 clamp(26px, 3vw, 34px)/1 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #fff; }
  .mgs-p { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .85); line-height: 1.55; }
  .mgs-go { margin-top: 6px; font: 700 13px/1 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1.2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #FFC72C; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .mgs-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
